1          /*===============================================================================
2           * dir_memlist_bug_quoted.sas - Bug regression: quoted DIR= is not dequoted
3           *===============================================================================
4           * Macro under test : %dir_memlist
5           * Expected         : with DIR="...", the root path and member paths are unquoted
6           *                    and files are classified as File
7           * Status           : OPEN 2026-11-02 - dequote() is not applied to DIR=
8           * Original defect  : the root row keeps the surrounding double quotes; every
9           *                    member path is built on the quoted root, fopen() fails and
10          *                    all members are typed Directory
11          * Fix              : apply %qsysfunc(dequote(&dir.)) before creating the root row
12          * Test passes when  the defect is fixed (run_all then reports FIXED).
13          *============================================================================*/
